      "cooked": "<p>Don't have all the names in front of me but found potential bug and don't see report stuff on app anymore</p><p>playing game with variant tachyon and Haka, and insula primus as the environment. Haka puts savage mana out. Tachyon has research grant out and a couple other ongoings along with several other ongoings with other heroes that don't matter for the bug. Velociraptor is under salvage mana and no villian ongoings or other environments on table. Taychon does experiment and one of the cards is blinding speed ( or whatever destroyes environments and ongoings) when selection comes up it wants to do velociraptor and I hit more choices to try and discard research grant instead. Game doesn't allow me to selecting or any other cards and ultimately makes me destroy the velociraptor.</p>",
